1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:04,160
My agent reads FalkorDB through MCP. It

2
00:00:04,160 --> 00:00:07,040
chooses tools to diagnose a checkpoint, compare

3
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:09,680
origins, and trace a passing ancestor.

4
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:12,340
It chooses a starting checkpoint and calls

5
00:00:12,340 --> 00:00:15,220
start training. The guardrail approves the evidence

6
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:17,220
and budget before the worker starts.

7
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:23,140
FalkorDB connects policies, training runs, trials, evaluations,

8
00:00:23,380 --> 00:00:26,500
failures, and decisions. The links preserve what

9
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:27,220
produced what.

10
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:30,640
The shortest path tool runs inside FalkorDB.

11
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:33,600
It returned the nearest passing ancestor one

12
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:36,560
hop away. The agent considered it alongside

13
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:38,400
17 eligible origins.

14
00:00:38,847 --> 00:00:41,007
Contracts tie a checkpoint to sensor and

15
00:00:41,007 --> 00:00:45,087
action meanings. The guardrail vetoes incompatible origins,

16
00:00:45,087 --> 00:00:49,327
stale hashes, incomplete validation, or unsupported budgets.

17
00:00:49,880 --> 00:00:52,760
Before training, the decision saves the model,

18
00:00:52,760 --> 00:00:56,440
tool calls, Cypher, parameters, and returned records.

19
00:00:56,680 --> 00:01:00,360
If FalkorDB is unavailable, planning stops.

20
00:01:00,833 --> 00:01:05,633
The worker trained 61,440 PPO steps, then

21
00:01:05,633 --> 00:01:09,073
reloaded the checkpoint for 180 validation episodes.

22
00:01:09,633 --> 00:01:12,513
All four suites passed the unchanged gate.

23
00:01:12,673 --> 00:01:15,473
Target collisions were three in sixty. Open

24
00:01:15,473 --> 00:01:18,033
had zero. Static and crossing had one

25
00:01:18,033 --> 00:01:18,833
each in 40.

26
00:01:19,333 --> 00:01:21,333
But the parent had two target collisions

27
00:01:21,333 --> 00:01:24,293
and no crossing collisions. Both measures got

28
00:01:24,293 --> 00:01:26,853
worse. Passing the gate does not establish

29
00:01:26,853 --> 00:01:28,853
an improvement, so I kept the demo

30
00:01:28,853 --> 00:01:29,893
policy unchanged.

31
00:01:30,733 --> 00:01:34,093
The earlier failure stays visible. 13 target

32
00:01:34,093 --> 00:01:37,213
collisions in 100 held out episodes. The

33
00:01:37,213 --> 00:01:39,693
separate confirmed checkpoint still has eight in

34
00:01:39,693 --> 00:01:40,253
100.

35
00:01:40,833 --> 00:01:44,113
That confirmed two dimensional checkpoint also collided

36
00:01:44,113 --> 00:01:46,913
six times in 40 MuJoCo target episodes

37
00:01:46,913 --> 00:01:49,873
without retraining. This is a separate transfer

38
00:01:49,873 --> 00:01:50,273
study.

39
00:01:50,893 --> 00:01:52,973
The graph and checksummed evidence make these

40
00:01:52,973 --> 00:01:56,733
results inspectable. EmbodiWeave. Built on FalkorDB.
